.com/images/microsoft/RE1Mu3b.png)\nMicrosoft](https://www.microsoft.com)\n\nSupport\n\n[Support](/en-us/)\n\nSupport\n\n* [Home](/en-us/)\n* [Microsoft 365](https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365?ocid=cmmttvzgpuy)\n* [Office](https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/microsoft-office?ocid=cmml7tr0rib)\n* [Windows](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/windows?ocid=smc_marvel_ups_support_uhfwindows)\n* [Surface](https://www.microsoft.com/surface)\n* [Xbox](https://www.xbox.com/)\n* [Deals](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/b/sale?icid=TopNavDealsSale)\n* More\n* [Buy Microsoft 365](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=849747)\n\n* All Microsoft\n  + ## Global\n\n    - [Microsoft 365](https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365)\n    - [Azure](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us?ocid=cmm4r4ppnhp)\n    - [Copilot](https://copilot.com/?fromcode=cmmuaql67jy)\n    - [Windows](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/)\n    - [Surface](https://www.microsoft.com/surface)\n    - [XBOX](https://www.xbox.com/)\n    - [Deals](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/b/sale?icid=DSM_TopNavDeals)\n    - [Small Business](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/b/business)\n    - [Support](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us)\n  + Software\n    Software\n    - [Windows Apps](https://apps.microsoft.com/home)\n    - [Outlook](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/outlook/email-and-c\n\nAI: ---\n**8-STAGE DEEP CoT REASONING MANDATE EXECUTION**\n---\n\n### **Stage 1 (Dynamic Tool-Catalog Lookup & 4 Mandatory Verification Gates)**\nThe raw SOP describes a **self-service password reset process** via a web portal. This involves:\n1. Entering a company email address.\n2. Verifying identity via a 6-digit code (SMS/email).\n3. Setting a new password.\n4. Confirming the reset via email.\n\n**Registered Platforms Analysis:**\n- **Platforms Mentioned**: None explicitly, but the process resembles **Auth0** or **Solandra** capabilities (user identity management, password resets, verification codes).\n- **Verification Gates**:\n  - **Gate 1 (Exact Function Match)**: The raw SOP does not explicitly mention API functions like `trigger_password_reset` or `send_verification_code`. However, the actions align with **Auth0** or **Solandra** capabilities.\n  - **Gate 2 (Active Platform Match)**: Both **Auth0** and **Solandra** are registered platforms.\n  - **Gate 3 (Problem Alignment)**: The problem (password reset via self-service portal) aligns with **Auth0** or **Solandra** capabilities.\n  - **Gate 4 (Parameter Completeness)**: The SOP provides `email`, `verification_code`, and `new_password` as inputs, which are typical for password reset APIs.\n\n**Decision**: Invoke `get_platform_tools` for **Auth0** and **Solandra** to inspect available functions.\n*(Note: Since the SOP does not explicitly mention a platform, we proceed with the closest match: **Auth0**.)*[{'name': 'get_platform_tools', 'args': {'platform_name': 'auth0'}, 'id': '6HP4kDZX6', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'get_platform_tools', 'args': {'platform_name': 'solandra'}, 'id': 'Bey96LWB4', 'type': 'tool_call'}]\nTool: {\n  \"platform\": \"auth0\",\n  \"aliases\": [\n    \"auth0\",\n    \"auth0_user_management\",\n    \"auth0 identity\",\n    \"auth0 platform\"\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"Auth0 User Identity Management tools for searching users, triggering password resets, and unlocking accounts.\",\n  \"functions\": [\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"search_user\",\n      \"description\": \"Search Auth0 user profile by email.\",\n      \"required_inputs\": [\n        \"email\"\n      ],\n      \"response_schema\": {\n        \"success\": {\n          \"found\": \"bool\",\n          \"user_id\": \"str\",\n          \"details\": {\n            \"email\": \"str\",\n            \"name\": \"str\",\n            \"blocked\": \"bool\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"not_found\": {\n          \"found\": false,\n          \"user_id\": null\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"error\": \"str\",\n          \"code\": \"int\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"trigger_password_reset\",\n      \"description\": \"Sends Auth0 password reset email.\",\n      \"required_inputs\": [\n        \"email\"\n      ],\n      \"response_schema\": {\n        \"success\": {\n          \"status\": \"success\",\n          \"email_sent\": \"bool\",\n          \"message\": \"str\"\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"error\": \"str\",\n          \"code\": \"int\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"unlock_user_account\",\n      \"description\": \"Unlocks a locked Auth0 user account by user_id.\",\n      \"required_inputs\": [\n        \"user_id\"\n      ],\n      \"response_schema\": {\n        \"success\": {\n          \"status\": \"unlocked\",\n          \"user_id\": \"str\"\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"status\": \"failed\",\n          \"user_id\": \"str\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\nTool: {\n  \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n  \"aliases\": [\n    \"coreid\",\n    \"coreid admin console\",\n    \"coreid_user_management\",\n    \"solandra group\",\n    \"solandra corp\",\n    \"solandra_ticketing\",\n    \"solandra_group\",\n    \"ticketing system\",\n    \"ticketing\"\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"Solandra Corp IT Support platform covering CoreID Admin Console user lookup, identity verification, temporary password generation, and ticket resolution.\",\n  \"functions\": [\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"search_user\",\n      \"description\": \"Searches the CoreID user directory by employee ID and returns the matching user's account status and profile details.\",\n      \"required_inputs\": [\n        \"employee_id\"\n      ],\n      \"response_schema\": {\n        \"success\": {\n          \"found\": \"true\",\n          \"user_id\": \"str\",\n          \"employee_id\": \"str\",\n          \"name\": \"str\",\n          \"manager_name\": \"str\",\n          \"department\": \"str\",\n          \"status\": \"Locked\"\n        },\n        \"not_found\": {\n          \"found\": \"false\",\n          \"user_id\": \"null\"\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"error\": \"str\",\n          \"code\": \"int\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"verify_caller_identity\",\n      \"description\": \"Verifies the caller against the CoreID identity verification checklist. At least 2 of 4 identity items must match before password reset can proceed.\",\n      \"required_inputs\": [\n        \"user_id\",\n        \"employee_id\",\n        \"manager_name\",\n        \"department\",\n        \"phone_last4\"\n      ],\n      \"response_schema\": {\n        \"success\": {\n          \"verified\": \"true\",\n          \"user_id\": \"str\",\n          \"matched_items\": [\n            \"str\"\n          ],\n          \"matched_count\": 2,\n          \"minimum_required\": 2\n        },\n        \"verification_failed\": {\n          \"verified\": \"false\",\n          \"user_id\": \"str\",\n          \"matched_items\": [\n            \"str\"\n          ],\n          \"matched_count\": 1,\n          \"minimum_required\": 2\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"error\": \"str\",\n          \"code\": \"int\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"generate_temporary_password\",\n      \"description\": \"Generates a temporary password for a locked user in CoreID Admin Console. Force change at next sign-in must remain enabled.\",\n      \"required_inputs\": [\n        \"user_id\"\n      ],\n      \"response_schema\": {\n        \"success\": {\n          \"user_id\": \"str\",\n          \"status\": \"success\",\n          \"temporary_password\": \"str\",\n          \"force_change_at_next_sign_in\": \"true\"\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"error\": \"str\",\n          \"code\": \"int\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"function_name\": \"resolve_ticket\",\n      \"description\": \"Adds the res